              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuva ku olwo Yesu yaatoolera okulaga Abeegeresebwa be ati ali n'okuja e Yerusalemu, n'okudaazibwadaazibwa einho abakulu ab'ebika, Bakabona Abakulu, n'Abanamateeka, era bamwite, ate azuukire ku lunaku olwokusatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
